// menu.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/menu/menu.cpp
//
// The sample exercises wxMenu / wxMenuBar / wxMenuItem: a frame with a menu bar
// ("File", "Menubar", "Menu", "Test", "Help"), a read-only log text control that
// reports every menu command, a popup menu on right click and a small dialog
// that repeats the popup-menu part.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\menu\menu.kwxts
//
// Icon: the C++ sample calls SetIcon(wxICON(sample)). On Windows that resolves
// to the "sample" icon resource compiled into the executable; on the other ports
// it expands to the sample_xpm[] array from ../sample.xpm. This port loads the
// same artwork as sample.svg (a pixel-for-pixel conversion of ../sample.xpm).

